      "content": "Wait, i'm a bit confused by the analogy. Can you just skip the metaphors and give me a concrete technical example? Like, if i have a table with columns [OrderID, CustomerID, CustomerName, CustomerEmail], how would you specifically apply 3NF to that to fix the transitive dependency?",
